 "description": "Ready-to-paste embed snippets (markdown GIF, markdown still, HTML <video>) for a demo, using stable raw.githubusercontent URLs on the 'demo-media' branch. Pure string generation \u2014 no network, no render. Owner/repo come from the repo's origin remote; the demo name from the directory basename. Pair with the demo-publish workflow so CI keeps the URLs fresh. See docs/EMBEDS.md.",
